- **Install the Firestore SDK**: First, make sure you have the Firestore SDK installed in your project. You can install it from the Firebase CLI or directly from the GitHub repository.
- **Configure Firestore**: Set up your Firestore database in your project. You'll need to specify which database you'll be using, including the collection you want to query.
